{"seq":3,"slug":"pool-anatomy","title":"连接池剖析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-connection-pooling/foundations/pool-anatomy","wordCount":1356,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"连接池剖析\">连接池剖析</h1><p>如果把连接池拆开，里面其实没有什么魔法——它就是几个数据结构加一套约束规则。无论是 Java 的 HikariCP、Go 的 <code>database/sql</code>、还是 Node 的 <code>pg.Pool</code>，剥到最内层都是同一副骨架：一组空闲连接、一组借出去的连接、一个等不到连接时排队的队列，再配上「最少留几条、最多开几条」的容量边界。这一篇就把这副骨架画出来，让你以后看任何一个连接池的实现或配置，都能立刻认出它的零件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个核心集合\">核心概念：三个核心集合</h2><p>连接池的状态可以用三个集合完整描述，它们恰好对应上一篇生命周期里的三个状态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>空闲集合（idle set）</strong>：已建立、已校验、随时可借的连接。借连接就是从这里取一个；归还连接就是放回这里。它通常用栈或队列实现——用栈（LIFO）能让最近用过的连接保持热、让长期不用的连接更快触达空闲超时被回收，HikariCP 正是用近似 LIFO 的策略。</li>\n<li><strong>活跃集合（active/in-use set）</strong>：当前已借给应用、尚未归还的连接。池靠它知道「现在有多少连接在外面」，也靠它来做泄漏检测——一条连接在活跃集合里待得异常久，多半是借了没还。</li>\n<li><strong>等待队列（wait queue）</strong>：当空闲集合空了、活跃数又顶到最大上限，新的获取请求没连接可分，就在这里排队，直到有人归还连接、或等待超时。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的大小关系恒满足一个不变式：设空闲数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{idle}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、活跃数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{active}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、池总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、最大上限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{idle} + n_{active} = n_{total} \\le n_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{active} = n_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{idle} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，池已饱和，任何新请求都只能进等待队列。这个饱和点就是线上「连接池满了」的精确定义，也是可观测性要紧盯的临界状态，见 <a href=\"../tuning/pool-observability\">池可观测性</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[getConnection 请求] --&gt; Q{空闲集合非空?}&#10;  Q --&gt;|是| T1[从空闲集合取一条&lt;br/&gt;移入活跃集合]&#10;  Q --&gt;|否| C{活跃数 &lt; 最大上限?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| N[新建连接&lt;br/&gt;直接进活跃集合]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| W[进入等待队列阻塞]&#10;  W --&gt; X{超时前有归还?}&#10;  X --&gt;|有| T1&#10;  X --&gt;|否| F[抛出获取超时异常]&#10;  T1 --&gt; U[应用使用]&#10;  N --&gt; U&#10;  U --&gt; B[close 归还: 重置后&lt;br/&gt;放回空闲集合]&#10;  B --&gt; Q\">flowchart TD\n  R[getConnection 请求] --&gt; Q{空闲集合非空?}\n  Q --&gt;|是| T1[从空闲集合取一条&lt;br/&gt;移入活跃集合]\n  Q --&gt;|否| C{活跃数 &lt; 最大上限?}\n  C --&gt;|是| N[新建连接&lt;br/&gt;直接进活跃集合]\n  C --&gt;|否| W[进入等待队列阻塞]\n  W --&gt; X{超时前有归还?}\n  X --&gt;|有| T1\n  X --&gt;|否| F[抛出获取超时异常]\n  T1 --&gt; U[应用使用]\n  N --&gt; U\n  U --&gt; B[close 归还: 重置后&lt;br/&gt;放回空闲集合]\n  B --&gt; Q</pre><h2 id=\"容量约束-四个边界数字\">容量约束：四个边界数字</h2><p>光有三个集合还不够，池的行为由一组容量边界决定。几乎每个连接池都有这四个旋钮（名字各异，语义一致）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>边界</th>\n<th>HikariCP 名</th>\n<th>Go database/sql 名</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大连接数</td>\n<td><code>maximumPoolSize</code></td>\n<td><code>SetMaxOpenConns</code></td>\n<td>池能开的物理连接上限，硬护栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小空闲数</td>\n<td><code>minimumIdle</code></td>\n<td>（由 <code>SetMaxIdleConns</code> 近似）</td>\n<td>保底常驻的空闲连接，抗冷启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大空闲数</td>\n<td>（等于 max）</td>\n<td><code>SetMaxIdleConns</code></td>\n<td>空闲连接超过此数就关掉，省资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接最大寿命</td>\n<td><code>maxLifetime</code></td>\n<td><code>SetConnMaxLifetime</code></td>\n<td>连接活过此时长就退役重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最小空闲与最大连接的差，就是池的「弹性区间」：平时维持最小空闲省资源，流量冲高时在弹性区间内临时扩容，回落后再收缩。HikariCP 有个反主流的建议——把 <code>minimumIdle</code> 直接设成等于 <code>maximumPoolSize</code>，即固定大小池，理由是固定池在突发流量下响应更可预测，不必现场付扩容的建连延迟。这些边界的具体取值依据，是调优章的主题，见 <a href=\"../tuning/pool-parameters\">关键参数调优</a> 与 <a href=\"../mechanics/sizing-strategies\">池大小策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发安全-池本身是个被争抢的共享资源\">并发安全：池本身是个被争抢的共享资源</h2><p>容易被忽视的一点是：连接池自己就是个被多线程/多协程同时争抢的共享数据结构。十几个工作线程可能在同一微秒里都来借连接、还连接，那三个集合与等待队列的增删必须是并发安全的。实现上有两条路：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>加锁</strong>：用一把锁（或读写锁）保护集合的增删。简单正确，但锁本身在高并发下会成为瓶颈——讽刺的是，为了管理「为提升并发而生的连接」，锁却限制了并发。</li>\n<li><strong>无锁/低锁</strong>：用并发队列、CAS、ThreadLocal 缓存等手段把竞争降到最低。HikariCP 之所以快，很大程度就来自它用了一个特制的无锁并发集合（<code>ConcurrentBag</code>），把借还路径上的锁竞争压到极致，并为每个线程缓存最近用过的连接以走快路径。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这条「池是共享资源、要并发安全」的认识，把连接池和更底层的并发数据结构连了起来——它用到的锁、CAS、无锁队列，正是并发领域的基本功，见 <a href=\"../../threads-concurrency/\">线程与并发</a> 与 <a href=\"../../lock-free-concurrent-data-structures/\">无锁并发数据结构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>连接池的骨架是三个集合：空闲集合（可借）、活跃集合（已借出）、等待队列（借不到时排队），满足不变式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{idle} + n_{active} = n_{total} \\le n_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>当活跃数顶到最大上限且空闲为零，池饱和，新请求只能排队——这就是「连接池满了」的精确定义。</li>\n<li>四个容量边界（最大连接、最小空闲、最大空闲、最大寿命）决定池的弹性；固定大小池在突发流量下更可预测。</li>\n<li>池本身是被多线程争抢的共享结构，借还路径的并发安全（加锁 vs 无锁）直接决定池的性能上限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"connection-lifecycle\">连接生命周期</a> —— 集合对应的连接状态。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../mechanics/sizing-strategies\">池大小策略</a> —— 最大连接数到底该设多少。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../tuning/pool-observability\">池可观测性</a> —— 把三个集合的大小暴露成指标。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../lock-free-concurrent-data-structures/\">无锁并发数据结构</a> —— HikariCP ConcurrentBag 一类结构的原理。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../threads-concurrency/locks/lock-core-ideas\">线程与并发</a> —— 保护池集合所需的锁原语。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>数据来源：HikariCP 官方 Wiki「About Pool Sizing」与源码分析、Go <code>database/sql</code> 官方文档。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"连接池剖析","id":"连接池剖析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个核心集合","id":"核心概念-三个核心集合"},{"level":2,"text":"容量约束：四个边界数字","id":"容量约束-四个边界数字"},{"level":2,"text":"并发安全：池本身是个被争抢的共享资源","id":"并发安全-池本身是个被争抢的共享资源"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"连接生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-connection-pooling/foundations/connection-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"获取与归还语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-connection-pooling/mechanics/acquire-release-semantics"}}